{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>וקציר</b> Two times in the Masorah: here, and 'all the days of the earth, זרע וקציר.' Surely Joseph did not come to annul the decree of the Place: 'זרע וקציר shall not cease' — therefore he said 'which there is no חריש וקציר,' for surely 'זרע וקציר' will not cease, and when they sow they will reap. And here they did not wish to sow it, and perhaps they would not live until the harvest — therefore he said 'חריש וקציר' and did not say 'זרע וקציר.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:24.002085321Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}